.claude/skills/detect-static-dependencies
.claude/skills/directory-build-organization
.claude/skills/dotnet-project-structure
.claude/skills/dotnet-webapi
.claude/skills/efcore-patterns
.claude/skills/filter-syntax
.claude/skills/find-untested-sources
.claude/skills/generate-testability-wrappers
.claude/skills/grade-tests
